                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is more clever than fun. So you are controlling a robot, and you have to explore an abandoned spaceship to find out what happened. Somewhat basic. You have to \"feed\" the robot because moving costs resources. Sometimes you have to hack a computer that mean real math or logic problems which is not fun at least at 1 AM. Then you can shoot some robots and solve some puzzles. The hacking mini-game is very complicated, and I envy those who get it.",
